  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03998e0d105361582658/step-7f9e3500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, carrot and zucchini until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add cannellini beans, Mediterranean seasoning, passata, the water, salt and brown sugar. Stir to combine and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to medium and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through half the butter until melted. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03998e0d105361582658/step-72a87710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine garlic and the remaining butter in a small microwave-safe bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant.\n• Cut continental rolls into slices. Toast or grill rolls to your liking.\n• Brush garlic butter over slices. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03998e0d105361582658/step-e9aaef20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian cannellini bean stew between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with garlic bread.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03998e0d105361582658/step-53aad730.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
